# ABP Dynamic Claims

Dynamic claims override token/cookie claims with latest values from database.

## Enabling
```csharp
Configure<AbpClaimsPrincipalFactoryOptions>(options =>
{
    options.IsDynamicClaimsEnabled = true;
});
```

## Middleware
```csharp
app.UseDynamicClaims(); // Before UseAuthorization
app.UseAuthorization();
```

## Tiered Applications
Configure remote refresh URL in UI application:

```csharp
Configure<AbpClaimsPrincipalFactoryOptions>(options =>
{
    options.IsDynamicClaimsEnabled = true;
    options.RemoteRefreshUrl = configuration["AuthServerUrl"] + "/api/account/dynamic-claims/refresh";
});
```

## Custom Dynamic Claims
Implement `IAbpDynamicClaimsPrincipalContributor` for custom claim logic.
